    public function creationReserveWei(string $symbol): string { $this->symbol($symbol);if($this->client->network->chainId!==202020)return TokenEconomy::creationReserveWei($symbol);$commission=match(strlen($symbol)){3=>'2500',4=>'250',5=>'25',6=>'2.5',default=>'0.25'};return bcadd(Units::parse('1'),Units::parse($commission),0); }
